                </div>
                <nav style="height:0px" class="dropdown-list-faq w-dropdown-list">
                  <div class="wrapper-text-faq">
                    <p class="text-14-150 opacity-80">The production time can vary depending on the complexity and length of the video. We follow a structured process that includes content collection, creative alignment, and sample creation before moving into full production. For a more accurate timeline, we recommend discussing your specific project requirements with our team.</p>
