                  <div class="wrapper-text-faq">
                    <p class="text-14-150 opacity-80">Yes, we offer flexible solutions for updating existing training videos. Unlike traditional videography, our animated content allows for seamless updates. This makes it easy to keep your training courses up-to-date without significant costs, ensuring your content remains relevant and accurate.</p>
